41388::$$$message_0290_0000_0000$$$::"This is the new character, Caren Hortensia's, cassock (center right) and the problematic exorcist battle uniform (left)."::
41389::$$$message_0290_0001_0000$$$::"I wonder if she's trying to seduce our gaze.[br]She's a shoo-in for this year's Best Not-Wearing-Anything Prize."::
41390::$$$message_0290_0002_0000$$$::"You're saying that? ...It's still better than being naked under a cape."::
41391::$$$message_0290_0003_0000$$$::"Huh? A-are we talking about the curry person?"::
41392::$$$message_0290_0004_0000$$$::"Heh. Who knows?"::
